<title>SINGAPORE: Electronic Resources in Psion deal.</title>
<headline>Electronic Resources in Psion deal.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Electronic Resources Ltd said on Wednesday it had clinched the rights to distribute the Psion Gold Card in the Asia Pacific.</p>
<p>The Psion Gold Card is a telecommunications card for personal computers that combines GSM (Global Standard for Mobile Communications), fax, modem and LAN (local area network) connectivity capabilities.</p>
<p>Developed by Psion Dacom, a unit of Psion Plc, it works worldwide on land lines and wireless networks like GSM and PCN (personal communications network).</p>
<p>It gave no financial details.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
